    - "Ch\xF3a\u207F b\u014De?"
    - "L\xED beh g\u014Da-ch\u014De?"
    - "Chhi\xE1\u207F-mn\u0304g, che s\u012B si\xE1nn-mih?"
    choiceAudioResourcePaths:
